Z||000006||SCCA FIERO||05-21-99||04:34 PM||||By the way...has anyone seen my dog? I went out on my bike yesterday with 7 friends and was looking for him. I almost got hit by this maniac doing about 100 mph so I called off the search. Also found some weird animal next to a sign that said "Welcome to Surry" laying on the ground in a few pieces. Many other dead animals along that road too and other signs. I think a tornado hit near by. 
